(text "USB-C, Eingangsschutz und Power-Mux" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22 32 0) (effects (font (size 4 4) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "170af9d9-20ba-4798-919b-6c05d7a87ee4"))
(text "Versorgung 5 V und 3,3 V" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22 335.48 0) (effects (font (size 4 4) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8bd63da6-a26a-47b5-ab8c-da1b30e3e8b0"))
(text "ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 mit Reset, Boot und Konsole" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22 537.02 0) (effects (font (size 4 4) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "da25cdc0-1a8f-4565-a3a6-e2f81acc28aa"))
(text "LED-Ausgang, Pegelwandler und 5-V-Schalter" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22 770.06 0) (effects (font (size 4 4) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6b7b322c-fa65-4123-b60d-1d59bf6fb8c2"))
(text "Sensoren, RTC und EEPROM" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22 980.68 0) (effects (font (size 4 4) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "de6227be-9bc7-4cd0-a57e-f6ae18e81402"))
(text "Befestigung" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22 1153.38 0) (effects (font (size 4 4) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4651fc29-18eb-4b1d-ad06-150b60cb41b3"))
(text "Entwurf V3: Umbau von V2 auf ESP32-S3-WROOM-1, erzeugt aus der V2-Netzliste (kicad-cli)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 1252.38 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3a3dfe28-e3a0-4635-bd4e-f7b585975fc3"))
(text "Entfallen gegenueber V2: STM32F411 (U2), ESP-12F (U4), Quarz X1 samt Lastkondensatoren, VDDA-Filter, SWD-Stecker H3, Umschalter SW4, Boot-Widerstaende des ESP8266." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 1258.38 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4bad3afd-05ca-4d16-841d-ae60c7b179cb"))
(text "Neu: ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 (U2), USB-C 16P (USB1), ESD-Schutz U11 mit C33 am VBUS-Pin, 0-Ohm-Bruecken R34/R35 in D+/D- (Modulseite USB_DP_M/USB_DN_M), BOOT-Taste SW5 mit Pull-up R32, Abblockung C30 (22 uF)/C31, R33 (510 Ohm) in TXD0." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 1264.38 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6749c3ec-0df7-4a0c-b4e3-a6ff066c1077"))
(text "Unbestueckte Plaetze (DNP, AE-02): C34/C35 (USB-Leitungen nach GND), R36 (D+-Pull-up; Wert und Schiene UNGEPRUEFT, 3,3 V nur als Platzhalter). C32 (ADC-Filter, Antrag A1): UNBESTUECKT (dnp), Freigabe des Nutzers fehlt; Platz bleibt." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 1270.38 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ddfc42c5-347b-431d-8ae3-71208d479692"))
(text "Geaendert: C1 = 1 uF (EN-Verzoegerung, bewusste Abweichung von V2: dort 100 nF, LCSC C28323), H6 = UART0-Konsole (TXD0 -> R33 -> RX_UART/H6.3, RXD0 <- TX_UART/H6.2, wie V2-Belegung), R29 = 31,6 kOhm (Wert des Teils C2930156)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 1276.38 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "67466ac9-4a1c-439c-a8f9-01ce09a82c71"))
(text "Unveraendert: Versorgung, 3,3-V-ODER-Schaltung (D2/D3), LED-Pfad (U3, Q1, Q2), LDR-Pfad (R22 = 1 kOhm wie V2), RTC, EEPROM, DS18B20, Taster, Test-Pads." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 1282.38 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a9b74420-f73e-481d-90e2-e08162776c93"))
(text "Noch nicht geprueft: Footprints neuer Teile gegen die Bestueckung, 3,3-V-Reserve des SY8301, Platzierung der Antenne." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 1288.38 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c4b109f0-0800-4528-91a2-ae89fc5334b4"))
